# What never belongs in an image build context. Every image of
# media-operator takes this directory as its context, so one file covers
# them.
#
# cargo writes one target tree at the workspace root on a workstation,
# and it holds gigabytes that no build inside an image reads: the image
# compiles the crates again on its own pinned toolchain.
target/

# The documentation site. Nothing in any image serves a page.
docs/public/
docs/resources/

# The Go coverage profile the gate writes on every run.
coverage.out

# Build outputs at the root: the operator binary a workstation build
# writes, and the rendered documentation site.
/media-operator
docs/dist/
